). It actually bonds with your clear coat to protect your paint from road grime, bird droppings, UV rays, and daily wear-and-tear. Washing your car becomes effortless.\nReady to upgrade your ride?\n📞 Call us or DM to schedule your consultation.\n📍 Sparkx Auto Detailing\n#CeramicCoatingBangalore #CarDetailingIndia #Akshayanagar #SparkxDetailing #GlossBoss CarWashBangalore","mediaUrl":"$12","thumbnailUrl":"https://scontent-blr1-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/780471269_17920647603422716_1384141512254244279_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=13kzfCoInGIQ7kNvwEjYM3D&_nc_oc=AdpH4HzmF4Cy0abWW3UCAL4UVJhhjA8j0-K8z6_iwo8Wpp47GA8tQ4bnOjm26yz7L6B4qOwWfx4tNVJGQLSr-nib&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-blr1-2.cdninstagram.com&edm=AM6HXa8EAAAA&_nc_gid=rQ0RltnSc7gLK3fy4ehdjg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLoxyLNzuM_2XfT16EDyPVFS45EOW_AXDnGmK12GBxvLO8exra3nKDU5ssQucAepOVNCbnCff8EHQ&oh=00_AQL1mk3WaLu_hqZ5_JoOF2Xos8wXB6j-dYtUpAntZ5Ao2w&oe=6ABD678D","permalink":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcOO1wOh5h4/","timestamp":"2026-08-19T12:53:33+0000"},{"id":"17865730380646934","caption":"Ceramic-coated and shining brighter than ever. ✨\n\nAltroz is all set to turn heads on every road. 🚗💎\n\n#TataAltroz #CeramicCoating #CarCare #Detailing #GlossFinish","mediaUrl":"$13","thumbnailUrl":"https://scontent-blr1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/776324616_17920222608422716_7394638182285992791_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=9kWq21xGoXUQ7kNvwEqprWE&_nc_oc=Ado14o4E7v5YbHnQyoV34PFyMW65DfEyNxEtDaPWz2KzO7jdHAJtMTSJPEGtfJCfBE5OtObeVUs7MM_KaxIJFxwX&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-blr1-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=AM6HXa8EAAAA&_nc_gid=rQ0RltnSc7gLK3fy4ehdjg&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQIb-_RHLQA0hBGNCr4EQz2HOfhAr7ji-oXlykLuTtSRjBfsUButAEdDdLqD0XDKGvXXmCxYf1Di6A&oh=00_AQKbOfhcydqEi7OhIuA4-v0-D4RLKD1kNjUTdf1TBREF0g&oe=6ABD5C15","permalink":"https://www.instag